In this file, the result of model in file HighDimensionMatrix-PINN_Combination is shown. The data set is transformed into high dimension matrix based on the algorithm in (Wu et al.), 2023, 
then supply to model in (Wang et al., 2024) and (Zhang et al.), 2025 individually to have the results as this file shows. 
These can tell the contribution of the high dimension matrix in the models' prediction quality.
